.8 ↑ 40.6 ↑ 93.9 ↑ 45.0 ↑ 53.2 ↑ 88.4 ↑ 53.2 ↑ 68.6 ↑ 98.1 59.8 ↑ 75.7 ↑ 88.1 ↑ 40.3 ↑ 44.8 ↑ 87.2 47.3 ↑ 41.7 ↑ ↑ 37.3 ↑ 45.1 ↑ 88.5 ↑ 41.3 ↑ 56.5 ↑ 92.3 ↑ 48.9 ↑ 62.9 ↑ 76.2 ↑ 33.8 ↑ 37.6 ↑ 82.3 ↑ 34.4 ↑ 36.7 ↑ 85.2 39.1 ↑ 48.0 ↑ 89.1 ↑ 42.7 ↑ 57.6 ↑ 93.0 ↑ 50.6 ↑ 65.7 ↑ 76.2 34.7 ↑ 38.2 ↑ 82.3 34.8 ↑ 37.3 ↑ ↑ 31.1 ↑ 34.5 ↑ 82.8 ↑ 36.2 ↑ 45.8 ↑ 86.6 ↑ 40.0 ↑ 60.6 ↑ 68.9 ↑ 29.9 ↑ 35.7 ↑ 72.6 ↑ 30.5 ↑ 33.9 ↑ 76.2 32.4 ↑ 34.5 82.8 37.1 ↑ 46.9 ↑ 86.6 40.5 ↑ 64.6 ↑ 72.0 ↑ 30.3 ↑ 36.8 ↑ 75.0 ↑ 32.3 ↑ 34.4 ↑ ↑ 48.9 ↑ 64.2 ↑ 92.1 ↑ 50.2 ↑ 67.2 ↑ 97.4 ↑ 55.6 ↑ 77.1 ↑ 92.7 ↑ 44.3 ↑ 69.6 ↑ 92.7 ↑ 41.8 ↑ 53.1 ↑ 95.7 ↑ 51.6 ↑ 65.9 ↑ 93.3 ↑ 52.0 ↑ 68.4 ↑ 99.4 ↑ 57.7 ↑ 77.7 ↑ 93.9 ↑ 47.5 ↑ 70.8 ↑ 94.5 ↑ 47.3 ↑ 54.8 ↑ ↑ 50.7 ↑ 59.5 ↑ 95.7 ↑ 53.4 ↑ 67.6 ↑ 99.3 ↑ 66.0 ↑ 77.7 ↑ 92.7 ↑ 46.8 ↑ 64.3 ↑ 93.3 ↑ 43.4 ↑ 51.4 ↑ 95.7 ↑ 52.5 ↑ 62.4 ↑ 95.7 57.5 ↑ 70.5 ↑ 100 ↑ 67.0 ↑ 80.6 ↑ 95.1 ↑ 50.5 ↑ 67.3 ↑ 94.5 ↑ 48.0 ↑ 53.1 ↑ Table 4 presents a comprehensive analysis of how different LLMs respond to various types of feedback over multiple repair iterations. Cross-LLM Performance Comparison. Table</figDesc><table><row><cell>Feedback</cell><cell>HE</cell><cell>GPT-4o CE SWE HE Claude-3.5 CE SWE HE Deepseek-R1 CE SWE HE</cell><cell>GLM-4 CE SWE HE</cell><cell>Qwen2.5 CE SWE</cell></row><row><cell cols=\"5\">Compiler 79.4 30Minimal 84.0 35.5 41.0 85.9 38.1 52.5 91.6 42.8 59.4 73.2 31.5 35.9 79.9 32.6 35.0 73.2 28.8 31.0 81.5 34.8 41.2 84.6 37.8 58.9 64.6 27.2 33.3 71.3 29.1 33.3 85.2 LLM-Skilled 90.1 38.9 58.4 89.6 42.5 62.1 96.8 48.7 70.9 85.4 35.8 63.2 87.8 39.1 48.0 76.2 LLM-Expert 90.2 41.6 50.9 91.5 47.1 61.9 98.7 55.9 72.6 87.8 37.7 55.6 89.6 38.0 46.3 95.1 Mixed 95.1</cell></row></table></figure>\n\t\t\t<note xmlns=\"http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0\" place=\"foot\" xml:id=\"foot_0\"><p>, Vol. 1, No. 1, Article . Publication date: February 2026.</p></note>\n\t\t</body>\n\t\t<back>\n\n\t\t\t<div type=\"availability\">\n<div xmlns=\"http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0\"><head n=\"11\">Data Availability</head><p>To facilitate the replication study, we have released our data and code at : <ref type=\"url\" target=\"https://anonymous.4open.science/r/FeedbackEval-EDC1\">https://anonymous.4open.  science/r/FeedbackEval-EDC1</ref>.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div type=\"references\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<listBibl>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b0\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Josh</forename><surname>Achiam</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Steven</forename><surname>Adler</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Sandhini</forename><surname>Agarwal</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Lama</forename><surname>Ahmad</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Ilge</forename><surname>Akkaya</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Florencia</forename><surname>Leoni Aleman</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Diogo</forename><surname>Almeida</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Janko</forename><surname>Altenschmidt</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Sam</forename><surname>Altman</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<idno type=\"arXiv\">arXiv:2303.08774</idno>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">Shyamal Anadkat, et al. 2023. Gpt-4 technical report</title>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2023\">2023</date>\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note type=\"report_type\">arXiv preprint</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b1\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Anthropic</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<ptr target=\"https://www.anthropic.c